---
// OmakaseMenu.astro - Menu em 3 Níveis de Experiência
---

<section id="omakase" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#090B0E] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Cabeçalho da Seção -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.3em] text-[#D4AF37] uppercase block mb-3">
        03 / Cardápio e Experiências
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
        Escolha a sua jornada gastronômica.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
        Trabalhamos exclusivamente com o menu degustação Omakase, onde os peixes mais frescos do litoral brasileiro e importações diretas do Japão são preparados diante dos seus olhos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid de 3 Opções de Preço (Ancoragem de Valor) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Opção 1: Menu Degustação Kuro (8 Tempos) -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 bg-[#11141B] border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#D4AF37]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase">Introdução</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Menu Kuro</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono tracking-wider bg-white/5 text-slate-300 border border-white/10">
              8 Tempos
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Uma imersão ágil e precisa focada nos clássicos da alta gastronomia japonesa contemporânea.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Investimento por pessoa</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mt-1">
              <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">R$ 290</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">/ conviva</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8 border-t border-white/5 pt-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>Entrada sensorial sazonal do chef</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>6 Nigiris nobres de peixes costeiros</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>Temaki artesanal de atum marinado</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>Sobremesa tradicional wagashi</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/5541999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Gostaria%20de%20reservar%20o%20Menu%20Kuro%20(8%20Tempos)"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase border border-white/20 text-white hover:border-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-all"
        >
          Reservar Menu Kuro
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Opção 2: Omakase do Chef (12 Tempos ★ Recomendada) -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 bg-[#181D26] border-2 border-[#D4AF37] flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(212,175,55,0.18)] relative transform lg:-translate-y-4">
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase bg-[#D4AF37] text-[#090B0E] font-bold shadow-md">
          ★ Experiência Assinatura do Chef
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6 mt-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37] uppercase">A Experiência Completa</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Omakase Signature</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono tracking-wider bg-[#D4AF37]/15 text-[#F3E5AB] border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
              12 Tempos
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            O ápice da nossa culinária. Peixes maturados a seco, vieiras canadenses, Bluefin Otoro e Wagyu A5.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Investimento por pessoa</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mt-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#F3E5AB]">R$ 460</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">/ conviva</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-200 mb-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">★</span>
              <span>2 Entradas quentes e frias de autor</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">★</span>
              <span>Nigiri de Bluefin Otoro com trufas brancas</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">★</span>
              <span>Vieira de Hokkaido com raspas de Yuzu</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">★</span>
              <span>Corte nobre de Wagyu A5 de Kagoshima</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">★</span>
              <span>Sopa Misoshiru especial de lagostim</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">★</span>
              <span>Sobremesa autoral com matchá ceremonial</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/5541999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Gostaria%20de%20reservar%20o%20Omakase%20Signature%20(12%20Tempos)"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-4 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D4AF37] to-[#B38F24] text-[#090B0E] hover:from-[#F3E5AB] hover:to-[#D4AF37] shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(212,175,55,0.3)] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Garantir Omakase Signature
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Opção 3: Experiência Imperial (16 Tempos + Harmonização) -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 bg-[#11141B] border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#D4AF37]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase">Exclusividade Máxima</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Experiência Imperial</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono tracking-wider bg-white/5 text-slate-300 border border-white/10">
              16 Tempos + Saquê
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Lugares centrais reservados no balcão com harmonização guiada por Sommelier com saquês Junmai Daiginjo.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Investimento por pessoa</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mt-1">
              <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">R$ 680</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">/ conviva</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8 border-t border-white/5 pt-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>Todos os 12 tempos do Omakase Signature</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>4 Criações raras com caviar de esturjão e uni</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>Harmonização com 5 saquês premium japoneses</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">✓</span>
              <span>Prioridade absoluta de data e horário</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/5541999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Gostaria%20de%20reservar%20a%20Experi%C3%AAncia%20Imperial%20(16%20Tempos)"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase border border-white/20 text-white hover:border-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-all"
        >
          Consultar Experiência Imperial
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Nota de Esclarecimento sobre Alergias e Restrições -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">
      * Por se tratar de peixes frescos sazonais e de captura diária, os cortes podem variar conforme a maré e disponibilidade semanal.
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
